    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for integrating with Coalesce, a unified data transformation platform built for Snowflake. Enables automation of pipeline runs, querying metadata about nodes and environments, user management, git account configuration, project management, and CI/CD integration for data warehouse transformation pipelines.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Coalesce Support\n Email: support@coalesce.io",
